@* The button that gives a result all the width it can have, and takes it back: in a
   workspace the panel takes the whole row of the grid; on the Queries page the menu
   folds away so the result gets the whole window (site.js, "Wide results"). The
   model names the result, for screen readers. *@
@model string
<button type="button" class="ghost small wide-toggle" data-wide-toggle aria-pressed="false"
        title="Use the full width" aria-label="Full width: @Model">↔</button>
